{"id":"e5f6b697b0ac9e9c","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-pi1-degree-pseudocomplement.md","title":"Pseudocomplement of a Pi-1 Degree","display":"thm-pi1-degree-pseudocomplement — Pseudocomplement of a Pi-1 Degree","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-pi1-degree-pseudocomplement","aliases":["67-thm-pi1-degree-pseudocomplement"],"display":"thm-pi1-degree-pseudocomplement — Pseudocomplement of a Pi-1 Degree","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]","[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§1 and §3","source_label":"pseudocomplement consequence of Lemma 7.6; repeated before Theorem 7.17","source_printed_pages":[99,112],"source_pdf_pages":[110,123],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-statement-checked; Lemma 7.6 proof dependencies not independently reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-pi1-degree-pseudocomplement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-pi1-degree-pseudocomplement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pi1-degree-pseudocomplement — Pseudocomplement of a Pi-1 Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e819ca0a85388cbb\" href=\"?note=e819ca0a85388cbb\" title=\"67-df-degree-pseudocomplement\">67-df-degree-pseudocomplement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1 and §3"},{"key":"source_label","html":"pseudocomplement consequence of Lemma 7.6; repeated before Theorem 7.17"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>99</span><span>112</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>110</span><span>123</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-statement-checked; Lemma 7.6 proof dependencies not independently reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,d_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathrm{PC}_T,\\operatorname{pc}_T\">\\(T,D_T,d_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathrm{PC}_T,\\operatorname{pc}_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e819ca0a85388cbb\" href=\"?note=e819ca0a85388cbb\" title=\"67-df-degree-pseudocomplement\">67-df-degree-pseudocomplement</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a> 的定义及固定一致基础理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\pi=T\\cup\\{\\pi\\}\">\\(T+\\pi=T\\cup\\{\\pi\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PC}_T\\bigl(d_T(T+\\pi);d_T(T+\\neg\\pi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PC}_T\\bigl(d_T(T+\\pi);d_T(T+\\neg\\pi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P_T\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pc}_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf P_T\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pc}_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书第7章印刷99页（PDF110页）引理6之后关于伪补的推论，并在印刷112页（PDF123页）定理17之前再次明确说明“every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> degree has a p.c.”。第一个公式给出具体伪补代表，第二个公式由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 度的存在代表句定义推出。</p>\n<p>局部推导框架：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_T(T+\\pi)\\wedge_Td_T(T+\\neg\\pi)=\\mathbf0_T\">\\(d_T(T+\\pi)\\wedge_Td_T(T+\\neg\\pi)=\\mathbf0_T\\)</span>；如果某度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_T(T+\\pi)\">\\(d_T(T+\\pi)\\)</span> 的交为底，由引理7.6取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 这个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 后果，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\leq_Td_T(T+\\neg\\pi)\">\\(b\\leq_Td_T(T+\\neg\\pi)\\)</span>。这正是最大下界为零的候选中的最大元。引理7.6在原书的证明引用第6章结果并称其直接，本次未独立重建该链，因此没有升级为全证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-pseudocomplement","status":"resolved","id":"e819ca0a85388cbb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-pseudocomplement","status":"resolved","id":"e819ca0a85388cbb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,d_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathrm{PC}_T,\\operatorname{pc}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]] 与 [[67-df-degree-complexity]] 的定义及固定一致基础理论 $T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,d_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathrm{PC}_T,\\operatorname{pc}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]] 与 [[67-df-degree-complexity]] 的定义及固定一致基础理论 $T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$；$\\Pi_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]；$T+\\pi=T\\cup\\{\\pi\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,d_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathrm{PC}_T,\\operatorname{pc}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","displa